.serena/

# Written by `assess` when no --plan is named. A generated stub, never the repo's.
aos-plan.json

# Written by `verify:real-runtime-strict` by default (#639): a local, disposable copy of whatever
# the lane just measured. Never the repo's unless `AOS_STRICT_CANARY_UPDATE_FIXTURE=1` deliberately
# writes the committed fixture at fixtures/confinement/strict-canary.json instead.
fixtures/confinement/strict-canary.local.json
